t {e}^{-x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int {e}^{-x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡|y| & =-{e}^{-x}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying the exponential function to both sides, we find the general solution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡|y|} & ={e}^{-{e}^{-x}+C} \\\\ |y| & ={e}^{-{e}^{-x}+C} \\\\ y & =\\pm {e}^{-{e}^{-x}+C} \\\\ y & =K{e}^{-{e}^{-x}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $K=\\pm {e}^{C}$ is an arbitrary constant. \n\nWe now apply the condition $y(0)={e}^{-1}$ to find $K:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{-1} & =K{e}^{-{e}^{-0}} \\\\ {e}^{-1} & =K{e}^{-1} \\\\ K & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the particular solution of $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=y{e}^{-x}$ that satisfies the condition $y(0)={e}^{-1}$ is\n\n$$\ny={e}^{-{e}^{-x}}.\n$$" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312770 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312771 13194139534827 true] [17592186312770 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312772 13194139534827 true] [17592186312770 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312773 13194139534827 true] [17592186312770 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312774 13194139534827 true] [17592186312770 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312775 13194139534827 true] [17592186312770 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534827 true] [17592186312770 1041 "selection" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312770 1104 #edb/ref 17592186312771 13194139534827 true] [17592186312770 1110 #uuid "95c9a681-e457-5107-8106-bb2d53d5a093" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312771 1034 "y={e}^{-{e}^{-x}}" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312771 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534827 true] [17592186312771 1111 #uuid "b3f0397d-f762-54ab-bfdd-1867271964b5" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312772 1034 "y={e}^{-1+{e}^{-x}}" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312772 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534827 true] [17592186312772 1111 #uuid "a20b712f-91dc-571d-9d75-f5df1c22a9f0" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312773 1034 "y={e}^{-1-{e}^{x}}" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312773 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534827 true] [17592186312773 11