 {e}^{C}$ is an arbitrary constant. \n\nWe now apply the condition $y(0)=1$ to find $K:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1 & =K{e}^{0} \\\\ K & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the particular solution of $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=xy$ that satisfies the condition $y(0)=1$ is\n\n$$\ny={e}^{{x}^{2}/2}\\,.\n$$" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312778 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312779 13194139534827 true] [17592186312778 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534827 true] [17592186312778 1041 "field-1" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312778 1104 #edb/ref 17592186312779 13194139534827 true] [17592186312778 1110 #uuid "910d6a58-2678-5801-bc3d-52e3e8d75283" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312779 1034 "e^{x^2/2}" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312779 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534827 true] [17592186312779 1111 #uuid "dfdc97e1-e0ec-505d-8873-6e496bf4b877" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312780 1017 #edb/ref 17592186312781 13194139534827 true] [17592186312780 1089 "q-355578" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312780 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534827 true] [17592186312780 1100 "Find the particular solution to the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}}=0$  that satisfies $y(1)=e.$\n\n$y=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312780 1113 #uuid "5ccd0d28-c2a6-553d-8006-d97ec4bdd759" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312780 1145 "We first find the general solution and then apply the given initial condition to find the particular solution.\n\nSeparating variables and integrating both sides with respect to $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}} & =0 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}} \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{y}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\,\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int \\,\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡|y| & =-\\frac{1}{x}+C\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying the exponential function to both sides, we find the general solution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡|y|} & ={e}^{-1/x+C} \\\\ |y| & ={e}^{-1/x+C}\\, \\\\ |y| & ={e}^{-1/x}\\cdot {e}^{C} \\\\ y & =K{e}^{-1/x}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $K=\\pm {e}^{C}$ is an arbitrary constant. \n\nWe now apply the condition $y(1)=e$ to find $K:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}e & =K{e}^{-1} \\\\ K & ={e}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, the particular solution of $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}}=0$ that satisfies the condition $y(1)=e$ is\n\n$$\ny={e}^{2-1/x}\\,.\n$$" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312781 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312782 13194139534827 true] [17592186312781 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312783 13194139534827 true] [17592186312781 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534827 true] [17592186312781 1041 "field-1" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312781 1104 #edb/ref 17592186312782 13194139534827 true] [17592186312781 1110 #uuid "786e4bda-f2b8-5dd2-b35d-3354a644b176" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312782 1034 "e^{2-1/x}" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312782 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534827 true] [17592186312782 1111 #uuid "5ec52982-94be-5d1f-baef-e86249afe96c" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312783 1034 "e^{1-1/x}" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312783 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534827 true] [17592186312783 1111 #uuid "53a823d4-ace3-5415-83d3-0905a1781274" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312784 1017 #edb/ref 17592186312785 13194139534827 true] [17592186312784 1089 "q-79373" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312784 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534827 true] [17592186312784 1100 "Find the particular solution to the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{e}^{-y}=4{x}^{3}{e}^{-y}$ that satisfies $y(1)=0.$" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312784 1113 #uuid "f5584487-f86c-5569-83ea-05d79037610f" 13194139534827 true] [17592186312784 1145 "We first find the general solution and then apply the given 